  "transcript": "Frog Game is a silly, soothing puzzle game for children and adults.\n\nIt offers a little logical challenge and a calm escape during stressful moments.\n\nI originally built it from scratch in Unity and C sharp and released it as an Android application.\n\nUnfortunately, I lost the latest version of the original game.\n\nUsing the visual and audio assets I still had, I created a similar browser game with JavaScript, HTML, and CSS.\n\nThe browser version recreates the core puzzle logic rather than being a direct Unity export.\n\nYou can find the playable version in the project section.",
